// Sita's Jewels — aranya kanda
// Source: Valmiki, Aranya Kanda, sargas 54 (verify)
// Migrated from the old script format. Not yet staged for the Ramlila stage.

>> scene sky style=bharni-earth
>> music dark
>> cast ravana at 0.3 y=-280 scale=0.6 mode=kachni
>> cast sita:exile at 0.4 y=-280 scale=0.75
South, over forest and river. He holds her by the hair and the arm. She does not stop fighting him.
Below, on a hilltop, five monkeys are sitting. She cannot call to them. But she is wearing her ornaments.
>> play drop \{\}
The five look up, shading their eyes. One of them is Hanuman.
>> scene ocean clear
Then the land ends. Water, for a hundred yojanas.
>> scene lanka clear
And then walls of gold.
-> END
